{"title":"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Loki, Moe, Nick and Ott are good friends. Ott had no money, but the others did. Moe gave Ott one-fifth of his money, Loki gave Ott one-fourth of his money and Nick gave Ott one-third of his money. Each gave Ott the same amount of money. What fractional part of the group's money does Ott now have?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/f/21faafca8dc85c5cdb9219c927ed77e095ae0948.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{10}\\qquad\\text{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{4}\\qquad\\text{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{3}\\qquad\\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{2}{5}\\qquad\\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"358\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since Ott gets equal amounts of money from each friend, we can say that he gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> dollars from each friend. This means that Moe has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87e9f9eb8f39820b3b8cd2c4b06e10d90e0d3b44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> dollars, Loki has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> dollars, and Nick has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> dollars. The total amount is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/5/38588fafb659d83dc4c41024358d54ce788611d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> dollars, and since Ott gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> dollars total, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/a/b0a4b7aa8a20166ffdd3d30ab99605c9a27ad153.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3x}{12x}= \\frac{3}{12} = \\boxed{\\text{(B)}\\ \\frac14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"158\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can assign any natural number to the price that Ott's friends gave him. For this example, we will use 5.\n</p><p>Moe gave Ott a fifth of his money, and also five dollars. So in total Moe has 25 dollars.\n</p><p>Loki gave Ott a fourth of his money, and also five dollars. So in total Loki has 20 dollars.\n</p><p>Nick gave Ott a third of his money, and also five dollars. So in total Nick has 15 dollars.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/d/75d5a70e101389d2bcc143e4d4ed62cb04b1b501.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\cdot3=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" /> which is the total money the group gave Ott.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/72808d4e6ce1fa811a541c2b9817dec611c8aa90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25+20+15=60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" /> is the group's balance. Therefore, the fraction of the group's money that Ott now has is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39ee5d308b5d329a36013ddfd6bcba27304b0b99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{60} = \\boxed{\\text{(B)}\\ \\frac14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"103\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F-ZvPoJdnfk\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F-ZvPoJdnfk</a>  ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 8\">2002 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2002\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last <br /> Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4